flowchart TB
accTitle: Extraction, interpretation and approval are separate stages
accDescr: Textract supplies document structure, Comprehend enriches the extracted notes, and confidence plus business validation controls automated submission or human review.
DOC[S3 scanned form]:::inputData --> TX[Textract fields and tables]
TX --> NLP[Comprehend entities from notes]
NLP --> CHECK{Confidence and rules pass?}:::decision
CHECK -->|yes| APPROVED[Approved result]:::storage
CHECK -->|no| HUMAN[Human review]:::warning
HUMAN --> APPROVED
APPROVED --> API[Idempotent API submission]:::output
